digraph OutcomeRoadmap {
 graph [bgcolor="#111827",fontcolor="#F3F4F6"];node [fontcolor="#F3F4F6"];edge [fontcolor="#CBD5E1"];

  graph [rankdir=TB, bgcolor="#111827", pad=0.3, nodesep=0.4, ranksep=0.5,
         label="MVP OUTCOME ROADMAP", labelloc=t, labeljust=l,
         fontname="Segoe UI", fontsize=22, fontcolor="#F3F4F6", dpi=150];
  node [shape=box, style="rounded,filled", fontname="Segoe UI", fontsize=14,
        fontcolor="#F3F4F6", color="#94A3B8", fillcolor="#1F2937",
        penwidth=1.4, margin="0.22,0.13", width=2.7];
  edge [color="#94A3B8", arrowsize=0.75, penwidth=1.4];

  setup [label="Isolated project setup", fillcolor="#1F2937", color="#94A3B8"];
  workspace [label="Invited access and\nprivate workspace"];
  sharing [label="Resumes, files, PDFs\nand protected sharing"];
  applications [label="Manual applications\nand submitted history"];
  git [label="ProjectForge authorization\nand Git checks"];
  integration [label="Basic ProjectForge\nintegration"];
  release [label="MVP verification and release", fillcolor="#1F2937", color="#94A3B8"];

  { rank=same; workspace; git; }
  { rank=same; applications; integration; }
  setup -> workspace -> sharing -> applications -> release;
  setup -> git -> integration -> release;
}
